# Offline embedding / Spark driver style local runs.
#
# JVM memory model mapping:
# - Heap: local Spark driver data structures, tokenized interaction sequences, model output.
# - Thread stacks: Spark scheduler/executor helper threads and deeper library call chains.
# - Metaspace/method area: Spark, Scala, Hadoop, and project classes.
# - Code cache: JIT-compiled Spark/Scala collection and ML hot paths.
-Xms1g
-Xmx4g
-Xss1m
-XX:MaxMetaspaceSize=512m
-XX:ReservedCodeCacheSize=256m
-XX:MaxDirectMemorySize=512m
-XX:+UseG1GC
-XX:MaxGCPauseMillis=200
-XX:+UseStringDeduplication
-XX:+HeapDumpOnOutOfMemoryError
-XX:HeapDumpPath=logs/offline-embedding.hprof
-XX:ErrorFile=logs/hs_err_offline-embedding_pid%p.log
-Xlog:gc*,safepoint:file=logs/gc-offline-embedding-%p.log:time,uptime,level,tags:filecount=5,filesize=50M
